@startuml
title 安全鉴权与 JWT 过滤流程时序图

actor 客户端 as Client
participant "Axios\nrequest.js" as Axios
participant "SecurityFilterChain\n(SecurityConfig)" as SecChain
participant "JwtAuthenticationFilter" as JwtFilter
participant "UserService" as UserSvc
participant "Controller\n(示例: FileController)" as Ctrl

== 受保护请求 ==
Client -> Axios: 发起 API 调用 (非 /api/auth/** 等排除路径)
Axios -> SecChain: HTTP 请求
SecChain -> JwtFilter: 进入过滤器
JwtFilter -> JwtFilter: 解析 Authorization: Bearer <token>
alt 存在有效 JWT 且上下文未认证
  JwtFilter -> UserSvc: loadUserByUsername(extractUsername(token))
  UserSvc --> JwtFilter: UserDetails
  JwtFilter -> JwtFilter: validateToken(token, userDetails)
  alt 校验通过
    JwtFilter -> SecChain: setAuthentication(SecurityContext)
  else 校验失败
    JwtFilter -> SecChain: 不设置认证（后续将被拒绝）
  end
else 无 JWT/无效格式
  JwtFilter -> SecChain: 跳过设置认证
end
SecChain -> Ctrl: 进入控制器(若需鉴权且未认证将被拒绝)
Ctrl --> Axios: 响应
Axios --> Client: 处理 200/401/403 等

note over SecChain
SecurityConfig:
- 允许：/api/auth/**, /api/files/thumbnail/**, /actuator/**
- 管理员：/api/files/admin/**, /api/admin/** 需 ROLE_ADMIN
- 其余：需认证 (JWT)
end note

@enduml

